    dict(t='Galpão visto do alto (plano de abertura)', sub='16:9 grande · anexe a referência de estilo e o robô sem boné', txt='Attached: the STYLE REFERENCE (painting style) and the approved ROBOT WITHOUT CAP. Wide 16:9 image, high resolution. A HUGE DARK FACTORY HALL seen from very high above, the camera looking down at about 45 degrees. Below, an immense production line: dozens and dozens of identical robots (exactly the attached robot without cap, small in the image) standing in perfect rows and columns on long conveyor belts, receding into the darkness, all facing the camera. A straight empty central aisle runs from the bottom of the image toward the center, and at the end of it, in the middle of the front row, there is ONE EMPTY SPOT (no robot there). Steel beams, catwalks and big hanging lamps, most of them off; a few weak cold-blue lights make pools of light on the robots; thin haze in the air. Very dark and mysterious, low visibility, but the rows of robots are still readable. Hand-painted cartoon style, soft brush texture, no outlines on the building, no text, no people.'),
    dict(t='Fileiras na altura dos robôs', sub='16:9 grande · anexe o galpão do alto e o robô sem boné', txt='Attached: the approved FACTORY HALL SEEN FROM ABOVE (same place, same colors and light) and the approved ROBOT WITHOUT CAP. Wide 16:9 image, high resolution. The same dark factory hall, now with the camera at the height of the robots heads, standing in the CENTRAL AISLE and looking straight ahead along it. On both sides, rows of identical robots (exactly the attached robot without cap) receding into the darkness, all facing the camera, getting smaller with distance. The aisle ends in the CENTER of the image at the front row, where there is ONE EMPTY SPOT on the floor (no robot there, a soft pool of cold light on the floor marks it). Cold blue light from above, haze, deep shadows, very dark but readable. Hand-painted cartoon style, soft brush texture, no outlines on the building, no text, no people.'),
